WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
The night before Pesach.

2
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:05.780
A family moves through their
dark home by candlelight.

3
00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:08.680
They carry a feather and a wooden spoon.

4
00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.240
They are hunting for crumbs of bread.

5
00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:14.450
Next morning, whatever
they found is burned.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Then they sit down to flat
bread and bitter herbs.

7
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.850
Why clear out every crumb,
just to eat like that?

8
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.410
In this mission, you'll
set out the Seder plate,

9
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:28.290
item by item, and find
what each one stands for.

10
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:32.520
Then you'll hear the four questions
the youngest child asks at the table.

11
00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:37.200
Your mission: find out why Jews
clear every crumb of bread from home,

12
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.550
then eat flat bread and bitter herbs.
